<object id="legend" label="Legend&lt;br&gt;A: blue dashed — DNS queries and DNS traffic routing, port 53.&lt;br&gt;B: orange solid — HTTPS requests / routing, port 443, then API invocation.&lt;br&gt;Numbers are independent per flow; a/b/c selects dev/test/prod (one environment per request).&lt;br&gt;Filled arrow: caller → callee, or explicitly labeled infrastructure traffic routing.&lt;br&gt;Normal responses are folded into request labels. Boundaries identify architectural domains." annotationKind="legend"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="html=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Arial;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9ca3af;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=15;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1870" width="900" height="290" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
<object id="allowances" label="Firewall allowances — apply to Azure Firewall AND AWS Network Firewall&lt;br&gt;Environment | Source | Destination | Port&lt;br&gt;dev | dev spoke subnet | Route 53 inbound endpoint IPs | 53&lt;br&gt;test | test spoke subnet | Route 53 inbound endpoint IPs | 53&lt;br&gt;prod | prod spoke subnet | Route 53 inbound endpoint IPs | 53&lt;br&gt;dev / test / prod | corresponding spoke subnet | *.execute-api.{region}.amazonaws.com | 443" annotationKind="comment" annotationFor="azfw"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;autosizeText=1;fontColor=#000000;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=none;fillStyle=solid;fontSize=20;direction=west;gradientDirection=north;gradientColor=#FFF2A1;shadow=1;size=20;pointerEvents=1;"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="1870" width="1500" height="290" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
<object id="parameters" label="Architecture parameters and routing roles&lt;br&gt;{region} and {Route 53 inbound endpoint IPs} are supplied parameters.&lt;br&gt;Lambda runtime is unspecified; technology: AWS Lambda.&lt;br&gt;DNS queries pass AWS Network Firewall in this fixture.&lt;br&gt;Route 53 resolver endpoints do not forward HTTPS.&lt;br&gt;API access remains subject to each API resource policy." annotationKind="comment" annotationFor="network"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;autosizeText=1;fontColor=#000000;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=none;fillStyle=solid;fontSize=20;direction=west;gradientDirection=north;gradientColor=#FFF2A1;shadow=1;size=20;pointerEvents=1;"><mxGeometry x="2570" y="1870" width="1150" height="290" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
